cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "CortexProbe: population receptive fields and lesion effects in convolutional models of the visual hierarchy"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Urme
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
abstract: >-
  A measurement instrument for population receptive fields in convolutional
  networks. Mapping stimuli are generated in-repo and unit activation
  timecourses are fitted with the Dumoulin and Wandell (2008) pRF model,
  validated against synthetic ground truth with held-out cross-validation
  grouped by sweep axis. The instrument is validated; no network has been
  probed, and the hypotheses the project exists to test remain untested.
keywords:
  - neuroscience
  - population-receptive-field
  - retinotopy
  - vision
  - lesion
